        "color": "#000000",
        "fontFamily": "Helvetica",
        "fontSize": 11,
        "originalText": "Removed: JWT auth, OAuth login, Stripe billing, credit quotas, sharing links, community publishing, comments, follows, bookmarks, push notifications, telemetry, RLHF reporting, S3, Postgres, Redis, hosted cloud sync, chat, agents, providers, OpenRouter, autocomplete, quick edit, document review, prompts, and knowledge-base retrieval.",
